{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670919555602467122","title":"控制器硬件开发工程师-汽车","description":"1. 制作各阶段的样品硬件LDI适配开发，生产BOM，出原理图，完成DFEMA，更新HSI并传递更新给底软\n2. 支持工厂的样板生产下线检查和在线bring up；\n3. 支持代工厂测试方案制定；\n4. 跟进DV/PV/台架/boxcar/整车测试进展，拉动失效样件失效原因分析；\n5. 推动替代料的开发验证，支持售后问题分析；\n6. 按照项目开发进度制定开发计划，完成开发样件按时交付；\n7.支持集成/整车测试用例编写，与测试人员对接完成及review测试报告；","requirement":"1. 本科及以上学历，电子工程、通信、电力电子专业等理工科相关专业；\n2. 熟练使用硬件开发工具，如示波器、万用表、电流钳等仪器；\n3. 熟悉模电、数电、能够读懂和理解硬件电路原理等；\n4. 工作细致、遵守流程、有良好的文档总结习惯；\n5. 具有良好的沟通能力和团队合作精神；\n6. 有责任心，主观能动性强；；\n7. 对新能源汽车有行业看法，对汽车有热衷，有责任心，认可小米汽车；","city_info":{"code":"CT_107","name":"南京","en_name":"Nanjing","i18n_name":"南京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786025331447,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7615833493755676955","name":"整车与系统工程类","en_name":"Vehicle and Systems Engineering","i18n_name":"整车与系统工程类"},"job_id":"7670919555602270514","city_list":[{"code":"CT_107","name":"南京","en_name":"Nanjing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"南京","py_name":"nanjing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000121","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_107","name":"南京"